  <item>
    <title>在北京精英中学和宁夏扶贫中学，“努力”有什么区别？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62c63b536b868f1a004525fe</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62c63b536b868f1a004525fe</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 07 Jul 2022 01:29:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>每年的高考季，人们总是提起一个词：“寒窗苦读”。高考被认为是最公平的选拔模式之一，而它让我们相信：努力就会有回报。但真的是这样吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期，我们跟随一位社会学家，探访三所截然不同的学校：一所宁夏的扶贫中学、一所北京中不溜的普通中学，和一所精英重点中学。她在这三所学校的差异和统一中，寻找着关于“努力”的真相。</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>- 音频制作团队 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>讲述者：李思宇</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作人：唐池</span></p><span></span><p><span>编辑：熊阿姨&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>声音设计：Supermassiver</span></p><span></span><p><span>图片设计：Jessi</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目运营：小米粒</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>- 部分素材来源 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>抖音用户@登围墙&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>抖音用户@大米video</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>- 收听方式 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐您使用「</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/噪音开始了/id1582118023" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/噪音开始了/id1582118023"><span>苹果播客</span></a><span>」、Spotify、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6139c18876177ac02fdcd804?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwMzc3M2RkZTBmNWU3MjNiYmFlMzVhZSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6139c18876177ac02fdcd804?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwMzc3M2RkZTBmNWU3MjNiYmFlMzVhZSJ9"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://h5.qishuier.com/podcasts/212144674150825985" data-url="https://h5.qishuier.com/podcasts/212144674150825985"><span>汽水儿</span></a><span>或</span><a href="../rss/making-noise.xml"><span>任意泛用型播客客户端</span></a><span>订阅收听《噪音开始了》，也可通过</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=966720770" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=966720770"><span>网易云音乐</span></a><span>、</span><a href="http://m.ximalaya.com/album/52905373" data-url="http://m.ximalaya.com/album/52905373"><span>喜马拉雅</span></a><span>、</span><a href="http://share.qingting.fm/vchannels/419233" data-url="http://share.qingting.fm/vchannels/419233"><span>蜻蜓FM</span></a><span>和</span><a href="https://m.lizhi.fm/vod/voicesheet/5199199899157049409" data-url="https://m.liz