    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Airbnb宣布退出中国后，网络上开始了一场隆重的赛博告别。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2019，地球村还没迎来黄昏，随时可以来一场不用扫码的旅行；2022，我们戴着半永久口罩，最大的愿望是去市中心吃一顿堂食。看着Airbnb里的那些订房记录，正如今天节目里一位朋友所说，“就像在梦中”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们怀念对世界的好奇和信任。</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>- 音频制作团队 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>讲述者：徐菁菁 Gefii 吃吃</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作人：泽希</span></p><span></span><p><span>编辑：唐池 熊阿姨&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>声音设计：Supermassiver</span></p><span></span><p><span>图片设计：Jessi</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目运营：小米粒</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>- 收听方式 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐您使用「</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/噪音开始了/id1582118023" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/噪音开始了/id1582118023"><span>苹果播客</span></a><span>」、Spotify、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6139c18876177ac02fdcd804?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwMzc3M2RkZTBmNWU3MjNiYmFlMzVhZSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6139c18876177ac02fdcd804?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwMzc3M2RkZTBmNWU3MjNiYmFlMzVhZSJ9"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://h5.qishuier.com/podcasts/212144674150825985" data-url="https://h5.qishuier.com/podcasts/212144674150825985"><span>汽水儿</span></a><span>或</span><a href="../rss/making-noise.xml"><span>任意泛用型播客客户端</span></a><span>订阅收听《噪音开始了》，也可通过</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=966720770" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=966720770"><span>网易云音乐</span></a><span>、</span><a href="http://m.ximalaya.com/album/52905373" data-url="http://m.ximalaya.com/album/52905373"><span>喜马拉雅</span></a><span>、</span><a href="http://share.qingting.fm/vchannels/419233" data-url="http://share.qingting.fm/vchannels/419233"><span>蜻蜓FM</span></a><span>和</span><a href="https://m.lizhi.fm/vod/voicesheet/5199199899157049409" data-url="https://m.lizhi.fm/vod/voicesheet/5199199899157049409"><span>荔枝</span></a><span>收听。</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><