    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>封城之下的上海居民都在做什么？方舱里的两个朋友告诉我，他们最快乐的事情是好好洗了次头；生活在浦东的小夫妻说，他们在过去半个月内，学到最实用的技能，是如何紧急帮邻居老人呼叫120，一次成功，一次失败。因为封城，这对夫妻在小区的楼顶办了自己的婚礼。我们想用一期播客，诚实地记录这段生活。</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>- 音频制作团队 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>讲述者：Tutti 米周 郭啸飞 多多</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作人：泽希</span></p><span></span><p><span>编辑：熊阿姨 唐池</span></p><span></span><p><span>声音设计：Supermassiver</span></p><span></span><p><span>图片设计：Jessi</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目运营：小米粒</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>延伸阅读：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/H2c9az6u0yqGGuTy4caNPg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/H2c9az6u0yqGGuTy4caNPg"><span>上海封城时，我们在楼顶结婚 | 噪音开始了</span></a></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>延伸音频：</span></p><span></span><p><span>被访者米周和Tutti的播客：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62029a7a0c35c9f95dca1a3d?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlNGZmMmE0ZTNlZGZjMmFiYjA1YTZlMCJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62029a7a0c35c9f95dca1a3d?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlNGZmMmE0ZTNlZGZjMmFiYjA1YTZlMCJ9"><span>504室</span></a></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>- 收听方式 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐您使用「</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/噪音开始了/id1582118023" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/噪音开始了/id1582118023"><span>苹果播客</span></a><span>」、Spotify、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6139c18876177ac02fdcd804?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwMzc3M2RkZTBmNWU3MjNiYmFlMzVhZSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6139c18876177ac02fdcd804?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwMzc3M2RkZTBmNWU3MjNiYmFlMzVhZSJ9"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://h5.qishuier.com/podcasts/212144674150825985" data-url="https://h5.qishuier.com/podcasts/212144674150825985"><span>汽水儿</span></a><span>或</span><a href="../rss/making-noise.xml"><span>任意泛用型播客客户端</span></a><span>订阅收听《噪音开始了》，也可通过</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=966720770" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/djrad