    <title>去还是留：一个望京韩国人的编年史</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/624516ba6ef9f0cd754e1d99</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">624516ba6ef9f0cd754e1d99</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 31 Mar 2022 02:33:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在中国生活了20年的韩国人大崔，在北京奇遇不断，不仅和韩国文在寅总统自拍，还误打误撞出演了46亿票房的中国电影。</span></p><span></span><p><span>他学中文、娶中国太太、落户望京，也完整体验了中韩20年的经济来往以及北京韩国城的变化。十年里，韩国公司陆续向东南亚转移，近三年因为疫情，中韩往返的成本越来越高。望京的韩国人已经离开了一大半。2022年，大崔和妻子也在考虑，是不是该搬家了。</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>- 音频制作团队 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>讲述者：大崔 华姐 吴喋喋</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作人：泽希</span></p><span></span><p><span>编辑：熊阿姨 唐池</span></p><span></span><p><span>声音设计：Supermassiver</span></p><span></span><p><span>图片设计：Jessi</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目运营：小米粒</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>- 收听方式 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐您使用「</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/噪音开始了/id1582118023" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/噪音开始了/id1582118023"><span>苹果播客</span></a><span>」、Spotify、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6139c18876177ac02fdcd804?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwMzc3M2RkZTBmNWU3MjNiYmFlMzVhZSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6139c18876177ac02fdcd804?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwMzc3M2RkZTBmNWU3MjNiYmFlMzVhZSJ9"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://h5.qishuier.com/podcasts/212144674150825985" data-url="https://h5.qishuier.com/podcasts/212144674150825985"><span>汽水儿</span></a><span>或</span><a href="../rss/making-noise.xml"><span>任意泛用型播客客户端</span></a><span>订阅收听《噪音开始了》，也可通过</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=966720770" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=966720770"><span>网易云音乐</span></a><span>、</span><a href="http://m.ximalaya.com/album/52905373" data-url="http://m.ximalaya.com/album/52905373"><span>喜马拉雅</span></a><span>、</span><a href="http://share.qingting.fm/vchannels/419233" data-url="http://share.qingting.fm/vchannels/419233"><span>蜻蜓FM</span></a><span>和</span><a href="https://m.lizhi.fm/vod/voicesheet/5199199899157049409" data-url="https://m.lizhi.fm/vod/voicesheet/5199199899157049409"><span>荔枝</span></a><span>收听。</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>- 本集节目