  <item>
    <title>没有人能懂一只北京雨燕的童年</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61dd033099c25dfd2a2fa3ec</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">61dd033099c25dfd2a2fa3ec</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 11 Jan 2022 03:54:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>去年夏天的一个周末，一只雨燕雏鸟从颐和园的古建上掉了下来。</span></p><span></span><p><span>北京野生动物救助中心听说后，给出了三条建议：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1、雨燕很难养，需要手动填食。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2、 这只雨燕还没睁眼，可能喂不活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>3、 建议放在僻静的高处，看大燕儿来不来喂它。</span></p><span></span><p><span>现在该怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span>在颐和园工作的杜梨捡到了这只小鸟，她要求自己决不能耽搁雨燕迁徙。一番努力后，她竟然真把小鸟健健康康送走了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>北京雨燕是珍稀物种，只有三千多只。它们现在已经从南非开普敦启程，今年4月，我们会在北京重逢。</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>- 延伸阅读 -</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_2pJ-untLl7ya9L03DKCog" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_2pJ-untLl7ya9L03DKCog"><span>你根本不知道它飞去了哪里 | 动物纪事</span></a><span>（公众号：先生制造）</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>- 音频制作团队 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：程衍樑 熊阿姨</span></p><span></span><p><span>编辑：熊阿姨 唐池</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作人：Aya</span></p><span></span><p><span>声音设计：时峥峰</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span>- 收听方式 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐您使用「</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/噪音开始了/id1582118023" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/噪音开始了/id1582118023"><span>苹果播客</span></a><span>」、Spotify、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6139c18876177ac02fdcd804?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwMzc3M2RkZTBmNWU3MjNiYmFlMzVhZSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6139c18876177ac02fdcd804?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwMzc3M2RkZTBmNWU3MjNiYmFlMzVhZSJ9"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://h5.qishuier.com/podcasts/212144674150825985" data-url="https://h5.qishuier.com/podcasts/212144674150825985"><span>汽水儿</span></a><span>或</span><a href="../rss/making-noise.xml"><span>任意泛用型播客客户端</span></a><span>订阅收听《噪音开始了》，也可通过</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=966720770" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=966720770"><span>网易云音乐</span></a><span>、</span><a href="http://m.ximalaya.com/album/52905373" data-url="http://m.ximalaya.com/album/