    <title>农村老家安上监控的这一年</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/618a4bd2fad86a854205abbf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">618a4bd2fad86a854205abbf</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 09 Nov 2021 10:00:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>监控已经进入了农村家家户户。在监控的注视下，农村生活有什么样的改变？《时尚先生》的编辑旁立回到了农村老家，她在过去一年的监控画面中寻找答案。旁立看到蜘蛛在结网，动物在嘶咬，家门口的银杏树青了又黄。</span></p><span></span><p><span>人们在监控画面外如常生活，邻里在争吵，警车开进村子，家人走到摄像头下挥挥手。那些想象中的变化，似乎并没有发生？旁立觉得，变化最大的，也许是自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 延伸阅读 -</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ArgWKuDs9EX8FH0mk_CUuA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ArgWKuDs9EX8FH0mk_CUuA"><span>雄鸡注视乡村：你家安装监控了吗？</span></a><span>（公众号：先生制造）</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 音频制作团队 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：程衍樑 熊阿姨</span></p><span></span><p><span>编辑：熊阿姨 唐池</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作人：Aya</span></p><span></span><p><span>声音设计：时峥峰</span></p><span></span><p><span>协力：Will Nigel 西奥</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 收听方式 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐您使用「</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/噪音开始了/id1582118023" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/噪音开始了/id1582118023"><span>苹果播客</span></a><span>」、Spotify、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6139c18876177ac02fdcd804?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwMzc3M2RkZTBmNWU3MjNiYmFlMzVhZSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6139c18876177ac02fdcd804?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwMzc3M2RkZTBmNWU3MjNiYmFlMzVhZSJ9"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://h5.qishuier.com/podcasts/212144674150825985" data-url="https://h5.qishuier.com/podcasts/212144674150825985"><span>汽水儿</span></a><span>或</span><a href="../rss/making-noise.xml"><span>任意泛用型播客客户端</span></a><span>订阅收听《噪音开始了》，也可通过</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=966720770" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=966720770"><span>网易云音乐</span></a><span>、</span><a href="http://m.ximalaya.com/album/52905373" data-url="http://m.ximalaya.com/album/52905373"><span>喜马拉雅</span></a><span>、</span><a href="http://share.qingting.fm/vchannels/419233" data-url="http://share.qingting.