  <item>
    <title>每月存5000，存够三十万就去隐居｜被抛弃的隐居一代</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/616e48ea80ab9d961cdbe7ef</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">616e48ea80ab9d961cdbe7ef</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 19 Oct 2021 03:14:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“采菊东篱下，悠然见南山。”我们对隐居的印象一向遥远又美丽。但一群年轻人正在实践一种别样的隐居方式：拿着打工攒下的钱，来到房价低廉的小城市，过有快递，有网络的隐居生活。</span></p><p><span>当隐居脱离田园，它为何能成为这些年轻人的心灵寄托？买了房子，真的就足够安全吗？存款能持续多久？他们能这样逃离一辈子吗？为什么很少有女性隐居者？</span></p><p><span>最终我们找到了一位27岁的年轻人。度过了十年打工生活之后，他来到了河南省鹤壁市，买了一套三万七千块钱的房子，过上了隐居生活。他的想法并不像预想中那么简单。</span></p><p></p><p><span>- 延伸阅读 -</span></p><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/FllP-zSuL3PPkUt2VMVp_g" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/FllP-zSuL3PPkUt2VMVp_g"><span>失落的年轻人：请向我推荐一个地方隐居</span></a><span>（公众号：先生制造）</span></p><p></p><p><span>- 音频制作团队 -</span></p><p><span>策划：程衍樑 熊阿姨</span></p><p><span>编辑：熊阿姨</span></p><p><span>制作人：Aya</span></p><p><span>声音设计：时峥峰</span></p><p><span>制作总监：王若弛</span></p><p></p><p><span>- 收听方式 -</span></p><p><span>推荐您使用「</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/噪音开始了/id1582118023" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/噪音开始了/id1582118023"><span>苹果播客</span></a><span>」、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6139c18876177ac02fdcd804?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwMzc3M2RkZTBmNWU3MjNiYmFlMzVhZSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6139c18876177ac02fdcd804?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwMzc3M2RkZTBmNWU3MjNiYmFlMzVhZSJ9"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://h5.qishuier.com/podcasts/212144674150825985" data-url="https://h5.qishuier.com/podcasts/212144674150825985"><span>汽水儿</span></a><span>或</span><a href="https://justpodmedia.com/rss/making-noise.xml" data-url="https://justpodmedia.com/rss/making-noise.xml"><span>任意泛用型播客客户端</span></a><span>订阅收听《噪音开始了》，也可通过</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=966720770" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=966720770"><span>网易云音乐</span></a><span>、</span><a href="http://m.ximalaya.com/album/52905373" data-url="http://m.ximalaya.com/album/52905373"><span>喜马拉雅</span></a><span>、</span><a href="http://share.qingting.fm/vchannels/419233" data-url="http://share.qingting.fm/vchannels/419233"><span>蜻蜓FM</span></a><span>和</span><a href="https://m.lizhi.fm/vod/voicesheet/5199199899157049409" data-url="https://m.lizhi.fm/vod/voicesheet/5199199899157049409"><span>荔枝</span></a><span>收听。</span></p><p></p><p><span>- 本集节目由JustPod与《时尚先生》专题报道组联合制作 -</span></p><p></p><p><span>- 互动方式 -</span></p><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7387305292" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7387305292"><span>@JustPod</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7606350368" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7606350368"><span>@先生制造</span></a></p><p><span>微信公众号：JustPod / 先生制造</span></p>]]></description>
