    <guid isPermaLink="false">61401b11018cc6fcf7ea0d34</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Sep 2021 02:44:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>9月21日是国际失智症日，它又叫认知症，或是被污名化为「老年痴呆症」。认知症的患病率在中国非常之高，我国85岁以上的老龄人口中，有三分之一是患者。我们或许没有机会体验认知症患者的生活，但照顾者的身份却离我们更近。如果家人得认知症了怎么办？我们采访了正在经历这个时刻的青年教师立早，让我们来听听她的记录。</span></p><p></p><p><span>- 延伸阅读 -</span></p><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LPs3dV_DaMYB5BJnqRCVaw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LPs3dV_DaMYB5BJnqRCVaw"><span>32岁这一年，我发现妈妈得了认知症</span></a><span>（公众号：先生制造）&nbsp;</span></p><p></p><p><span>- 音频制作团队 -</span></p><p><span>策划：程衍樑 刘敏</span></p><p><span>编辑：杨一</span></p><p><span>制作人：泽希</span></p><p><span>声音设计：佳杰</span></p><p><span>制作总监：王若弛</span></p><p></p><p><span>- 收听方式 -</span></p><p><span>推荐您使用「</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/噪音开始了/id1582118023" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/噪音开始了/id1582118023"><span>苹果播客</span></a><span>」、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6139c18876177ac02fdcd804?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwMzc3M2RkZTBmNWU3MjNiYmFlMzVhZSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6139c18876177ac02fdcd804?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwMzc3M2RkZTBmNWU3MjNiYmFlMzVhZSJ9"><span>小宇宙</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://h5.qishuier.com/podcasts/212144674150825985" data-url="https://h5.qishuier.com/podcasts/212144674150825985"><span>汽水儿</span></a><span>或</span><a href="https://justpodmedia.com/rss/making-noise.xml" data-url="https://justpodmedia.com/rss/making-noise.xml"><span>任意泛用型播客客户端</span></a><span>订阅收听《噪音开始了》，也可通过</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=966720770" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=966720770"><span>网易云音乐</span></a><span>、</span><a href="http://m.ximalaya.com/album/52905373" data-url="http://m.ximalaya.com/album/52905373"><span>喜马拉雅</span></a><span>、</span><a href="http://share.qingting.fm/vchannels/419233" data-url="http://share.qingting.fm/vchannels/419233"><span>蜻蜓FM</span></a><span>和</span><a href="https://m.lizhi.fm/vod/voicesheet/5199199899157049409" data-url="https://m.lizhi.fm/vod/voicesheet/5199199899157049409"><span>荔枝</span></a><span>收听。</span></p><p></p><p><span><span>- 本集节目由JustPod与《时尚先生》专题报道组联合制作 -&nbsp;</span></span></p><p></p><p><span>- 互动方式 -</span></p><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7387305292" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7387305292"><span>@JustPod</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7606350368" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7606350368"><span>@先生制造</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>微信公众号：JustPod / 先生制造</span></p>]]></description>
